2009), Theorem IV.3.3 (finite boundary instance)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>158</span><span>159</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\)</span>、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{S_2}\">\\(\\vdash_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\times=\\{\\mathsf a_0,\\neg\\mathsf a_0\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_\\times=\\{\\mathsf a_0,\\neg\\mathsf a_0\\}\\)</span>，命题码、有限证明、PCons、PSat、PFinSat 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"37fe734d9e5b5888\" href=\"?note=37fe734d9e5b5888\" title=\"62-df-propositional-code\">62-df-propositional-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}clash}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\bigl[\n\\neg\\mathsf{PCons}(\\Gamma_\\times)\\land\\neg\\mathsf{PFinSat}(\\Gamma_\\times)\\land\\neg\\exists f\\ \\mathsf{PSat}(\\Gamma_\\times,f)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}clash}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\bigl[\n\\neg\\mathsf{PCons}(\\Gamma_\\times)\\land\\neg\\mathsf{PFinSat}(\\Gamma_\\times)\\land\\neg\\exists f\\ \\mathsf{PSat}(\\Gamma_\\times,f)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各一行前提列分别证明 a₀ 和 ¬a₀，故不相容。任一总二值赋值在该原子与其否定上恰有一个取真；整个 Γ× 已是不可满足有限子集。该例同时检验有限子集量词包括完整的有限 Γ、否定真值方向和非空证明见证，避免把空集的可满足性推广到矛盾集。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem IV.3.3 (finite boundary instance)；纸面页 140, 141；PDF 页 158, 159。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-propositional-code","status":"resolved","id":"37fe734d9e5b5888","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-propositional-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。 $\\Gamma_\\times=\\{\\mathsf a_0,\\neg\\mathsf a_0\\}$，命题码、有限证明、PCons、PSat、PFinSat 见 [[62-df-propositional-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。 $\\Gamma_\\times=\\{\\mathsf a_0,\\neg\\mathsf a_0\\}$，命题码、有限证明、PCons、PSat、PFinSat 见 [[62-df-propositional-code]]。","embed"